t{cm},$ respectively?" :question/worked-solution "We can find the volume $V$ of the rectangular prism using the formula\n\n$$\nV=lwh,\n$$\n\nwhere $l$ is the length, $w$ is the width, and $h$ is the height of the solid.\n\nSubstituting \n\n$$\nl=7\\,\\text{cm},\\,w=\\sqrt{5}\\,\\text{cm},\\,h=2\\sqrt{5}\\,\\text{cm}\n$$\n\ninto the formula, we obtain\n\n$$\nV=7\\cdot \\sqrt{5}\\cdot 2\\sqrt{5}=14\\sqrt{25}=70\\,{\\text{cm}}^{3}.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-c9b4e360-8590-5911-8f82-2ddfc942a0b5"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-c9b4e360-8590-5911-8f82-2ddfc942a0b5" :answer-field/id #uuid "c9b4e360-8590-5911-8f82-2ddfc942a0b5" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-7f7f4592-9da2-5474-a594-ba6a8d8c4cbe" :answer-field/choices ["answer-89b6545b-5746-51bf-aca8-6f1e543c301e" "answer-fec1133d-d1fa-5ad9-a094-ba9d15c6621c" "answer-3fbb90ef-bc77-5686-9580-446faecd9e3c" "answer-7f7f4592-9da2-5474-a594-ba6a8d8c4cbe" "answer-f738c182-3c34-5f58-9454-a452628c6586"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-89b6545b-5746-51bf-aca8-6f1e543c301e" :answer/id #uuid "89b6545b-5746-51bf-aca8-6f1e543c301e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "14\\,{\\text{cm}}^{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-fec1133d-d1fa-5ad9-a094-ba9d15c6621c" :answer/id #uuid "fec1133d-d1fa-5ad9-a094-ba9d15c6621c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "14\\sqrt{5}\\,{\\text{cm}}^{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3fbb90ef-bc77-5686-9580-446faecd9e3c" :answer/id #uuid "3fbb90ef-bc77-5686-9580-446faecd9e3c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "35\\,{\\text{cm}}^{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7f7f4592-9da2-5474-a594-ba6a8d8c4cbe" :answer/id #uuid "7f7f4592-9da2-5474-a594-ba6a8d8c4cbe" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "70\\,{\\text{cm}}^{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-f738c182-3c34-5f58-9454-a452628c6586" :answer/id #uuid "f738c182-3c34-5f58-9454-a452628c6586" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7\\sqrt{5}\\,{\\text{cm}}^{3}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-78b1f6d8-2df3-5686-9ee0-696c5e38afe8" :question/id #uuid "78b1f6d8-2df3-5686-9ee0-696c5e38afe8" :question/math-academy-id "q-118851" :question/problem "The height of a rectangular solid is $2\\sqrt{3}\\,\\text{m}$ and its volume is $24\\sqrt{3}\\,{\\text{m}}^{3}.$ If the base  (length × width) of the solid is a square, find the length of the solid." :question/worked-solution "We can find the volume $V$ of the rectangular prism using the formula\n\n$$\nV=lwh,\n$$\n\nwhere $l$ is the length, $w$ is the width, and $h$ is the height of the solid.\n\nSince the base of the rectangular solid is a square, we have that \n\n$$\nl=w.\n$$\n\nSubstituting \n\n$$\nV=24\\sqrt{3},\\,h=2\\sqrt{3},\\,w=l\n$$\n\ninto the formula, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}V & =lwh \\\\ V & ={l}^{2}h \\\\ 24\\sqrt{3} & ={l}^{2}\\cdot 2\\sqrt{3} \\\\ {l}^{2} & =12 \\\\ l & =2\\sqrt{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the length is $2\\sqrt{3}\\,\\text{m}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-ee07a34b-76bb-5c4b-82db-1a6944f98c6a"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-ee07a34b-76bb-5c4b-82db-1a6944f98c6a" :answer-field/id #uuid "ee07a34b-76bb-5c4b-82db-1a6944f98c6a" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-9cc7fd52-09a9-5439-9621-e9bed86e9431" :answer-field/choices ["answer-07e2e2ed-aed5-5203-a591-0631b899ac63" "answer-9cc7fd52-09a9-5439-9621-e9bed86e9431" "answer-ee949a8d-6d43-5d32-b575-97cfcab50d2d" "answer-4f4e1721-1eb0-5dfe-a24f-dc033aec8da7" "answer-2b8af707-5ffc-56b6-b779-92eaa5dc63aa"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-07e2e2ed-aed5-5203-a591-0631b899ac63" :answer/id #uuid "07e2e2ed-aed5-52