are, we have that \n\n$$\nl=w.\n$$\n\nSubstituting \n\n$$\nV=675,\\,h=15,\\,w=l\n$$\n\ninto the formula, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}V & =lwh \\\\ V & ={l}^{2}h \\\\ 675 & ={l}^{2}\\cdot 15 \\\\ {l}^{2} & =45 \\\\ l & =3\\sqrt{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the length is $3\\sqrt{5}\\,\\text{cm}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id 17592186117205 :answer-field/correct "answer-cdc461e4-747e-5e77-a24e-b19010b9d344" :answer-field/choices ["answer-7817568b-5170-5238-8a2f-a1349a4c027e" "answer-cdc461e4-747e-5e77-a24e-b19010b9d344" "answer-0c00bdfc-7553-5b8a-9994-e88f4b109a32" "answer-dd28a32c-2749-5e10-9cfd-4d0c0a86a6f4" "answer-2a2ed6a0-1263-58cb-824d-1b8aba422512"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-7817568b-5170-5238-8a2f-a1349a4c027e" :answer/id #uuid "7817568b-5170-5238-8a2f-a1349a4c027e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\,\\text{cm}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-cdc461e4-747e-5e77-a24e-b19010b9d344" :answer/id #uuid "cdc461e4-747e-5e77-a24e-b19010b9d344" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3\\sqrt{5}\\,\\text{cm}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0c00bdfc-7553-5b8a-9994-e88f4b109a32" :answer/id #uuid "0c00bdfc-7553-5b8a-9994-e88f4b109a32" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5\\,\\text{cm}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-dd28a32c-2749-5e10-9cfd-4d0c0a86a6f4" :answer/id #uuid "dd28a32c-2749-5e10-9cfd-4d0c0a86a6f4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5\\sqrt{15}\\,\\text{cm}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2a2ed6a0-1263-58cb-824d-1b8aba422512" :answer/id #uuid "2a2ed6a0-1263-58cb-824d-1b8aba422512" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5\\sqrt{3}\\,\\text{cm}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id 17592186233065 :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-64f1ed4f-91f9-52d7-96d3-6559b0cf6609"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-64f1ed4f-91