e given expression and use the product rule for logarithms, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4\\operatorname{log}⁡2+4\\operatorname{log}⁡4+4\\operatorname{log}⁡8 & =4(\\operatorname{log}⁡2+4\\operatorname{log}⁡4+\\operatorname{log}⁡8) \\\\  & =4\\operatorname{log}⁡(2\\cdot 4\\cdot 8) \\\\  & =4\\operatorname{log}⁡64.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n4\\operatorname{log}⁡2+4\\operatorname{log}⁡4+4\\operatorname{log}⁡8=4\\operatorname{log}⁡64.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-c885df1b-32ff-5811-ba54-2d8aa2af7d3b"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-c885df1b-32ff-5811-ba54-2d8aa2af7d3b" :answer-field/id #uuid "c885df1b-32ff-5811-ba54-2d8aa2af7d3b" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-d52273df-2cdc-5121-ae5a-a9b18d565cb2" :answer-field/choices ["answer-32ec0506-3bbd-5450-aec5-45053e66e796" "answer-3ffc69cd-1816-56af-b4a4-2f614d0c6c05" "answer-d52273df-2cdc-5121-ae5a-a9b18d565cb2" "answer-0c7cf433-98e4-521c-8756-1aaa0de20101" "answer-3703a9c5-f286-515d-ba66-fc309d04cfa3"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-32ec0506-3bbd-5450-aec5-45053e66e796" :answer/id #uuid "32ec0506-3bbd-5450-aec5-45053e66e796" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "12\\operatorname{log}⁡14" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3ffc69cd-1816-56af-b4a4-2f614d0c6c05" :answer/id #uuid "3ffc69cd-1816-56af-b4a4-2f614d0c6c05" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4\\operatorname{log}⁡14" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d52273df-2cdc-5121-ae5a-a9b18d565cb2" :answer/id #uuid "d52273df-2cdc-5121-ae5a-a9b18d565cb2" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4\\operatorname{log}⁡64" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0c7cf433-98e4-521c-8756-1aaa0de20101" :answer/id #uuid "0c7cf433-98e4-521c-8756-1aaa0de20101" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "64\\operatorname{log}⁡64" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3703a9c5-f286-515d-ba66-fc309d04cfa3" :answer/id #uuid "3703a9c5-f286-515d-ba66-fc309d04cfa3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{log}⁡64" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-f62edb2c-be7a-51bc-a4d3-e51bf196542b" :question/id #uuid "f62edb2c-be7a-51bc-a4d3-e51bf196542b" :question/math-academy-id "q-250763" :question/problem "Write the following expression as a single logarithm.\n\n$4\\operatorname{log}⁡t+4\\operatorname{log}⁡({t}^{2})+4\\operatorname{log}⁡({t}^{3})=4\\operatorname{log}⁡(${{field-1}}$)$" :question/worked-solution "First, let's recall the product rule for logarithms:\n\n$$\n{log}_{n}⁡a+{log}_{n}⁡b={log}_{n}⁡(ab)\n$$\n\nIf we factor the given expression and use the product rule for logarithms, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4\\operatorname{log}⁡t+4\\operatorname{log}⁡({t}^{2})+4\\operatorname{log}⁡({t}^{3}) & =4(\\operatorname{log}⁡t+\\operatorname{log}⁡({t}^{2})+\\operatorname{log}⁡({t}^{3})) \\\\  & =4\\operatorname{log}⁡(t\\cdot {t}^{2}\\cdot {t}^{3}) \\\\  & =4\\operatorname{log}⁡({t}^{1+2+3}) \\\\  & =4\\operatorname{log}⁡({t}^{6}).\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-00dd99a1-dae8-5610-99d8-c9c6b36aae72"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-00dd99a1-dae8-5610-99d8-c9c6b36aae72" :answer-field/id #uuid "00dd99a1-dae8-5610-99d8-c9c6b36aae72" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank :answer-field/correct "answer-04eea80b-51f5-55aa-bacb-612eb84f806e" :answer-field/choices ["answer-04eea80b-51f5-55aa-bacb-612eb84f806e"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-04eea80b-51f5-55aa-bacb-612eb84f806e" :answer/id #uuid "04eea80b-51f5-55aa-bacb-612eb84f806e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "t^6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-56e99923-e71e-5783-b293-6f220455cbaa" :question/id #uuid "56e99923-e71e-5783-b293-6f220455cbaa" :question/math-academy-id "q-66752" :question/problem "Express $5{log}_{3}⁡4+5{log}_{3}⁡5$ as a single logarithm." :question/worked-solution "First, let's recall the product rule for logarithms:\n\n$$\n{log}_{n}⁡a+{log}_{n}⁡b={log}_{n}⁡(ab)\n$$\n\nIf we factor the given expression and use the product rule for logarithms, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5{log}_{3}⁡4+5{log}_{3}⁡5 & =5({log}_{3}⁡4+{log}_{3}⁡5) \\\\  & =5{log}_{3}⁡(4\\cdot 5) \\\\  & =5{log}_{3}⁡20.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n5{log}_{3}⁡4+5{log}_{3}⁡5=5{log}_{3}⁡20.\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-03f6e7c1-29f6-526a-acd6-fbd0f2dceb15"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-03f6e7c1-29f6-526a-acd6-fbd0f2dceb15" :answer-field/id #uuid "03f6e7c1-29f6-526a-acd6-fbd0f2dceb15" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-d91f4297-0733-5082-b97e-b9972dff4d1a" :answer-field/choices ["answer-445c01e6-52e6-54d8-8abe-4213152f1a48" "answer-9457237b-99a1-52c8-b7cd-c0936c7acc0c" "answer-d91f4297-0733-5082-b97e-b9972dff4d1a" "answer-0db5a639-f3fe-598f-ab82-81a7029de9bc" "answer-82fdc84f-7132-5172-8c03-9226be816ca4"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-445c01e6-52e6-54d8-8abe-4213152f1a48" :answer/id #uuid "445c01e6-52e6-54d8-8abe-4213152f1a48" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10{log}_{3}⁡20" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9457237b-99a1-52c8-b7cd-c0936c7acc0c" :answer/id #uuid "9457237b-99a1-52c8-b7cd-c0936c7acc0c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10{log}_{3}⁡9" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d91f4297-0733-5082-b97e-b9972dff4d1a" :answer/id #uuid "d91f4297-0733-5082-b97e-b9972dff4d1a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5{log}_{3}⁡20" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-0db5a639-f3fe-598f-ab82-81a7029de9bc" :answer/id #uuid "0db5a639-f3fe-598f-ab82-81a7029de9bc" :answer/type :answer.type/